1
00:00:00,502 --> 00:00:03,143
Porter is an early payment prototype on Arc.

2
00:00:03,957 --> 00:00:08,042
A sender locks a scheduled USDC payout, plus a caller bounty.

3
00:00:10,402 --> 00:00:12,296
Choose the payee and the due time.

4
00:00:13,122 --> 00:00:16,195
The labeled defaults are ten cents for the payee and one cent

5
00:00:16,215 --> 00:00:16,988
for the caller.

6
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:21,447
Approval is exactly eleven cents, followed by room funding.

7
00:00:23,602 --> 00:00:26,759
Once a room is due, any caller may settle it once.

8
00:00:27,585 --> 00:00:30,652
The caller estimates the fee and signs the transaction.

9
00:00:31,477 --> 00:00:33,654
Nothing executes automatically.

10
00:00:35,802 --> 00:00:38,649
This existing mainnet room locked eleven cents.

11
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:42,368
Settlement paid ten cents to the payee and one cent to the

12
00:00:42,388 --> 00:00:44,282
caller, in the same transaction.

13
00:00:46,435 --> 00:00:49,327
The public opening and settlement links let a judge inspect

14
00:00:49,347 --> 00:00:50,893
the real Arc transactions.

15
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,857
They are the existing proof, not new payments made for this

16
00:00:54,877 --> 00:00:55,521
recording.

17
00:00:57,668 --> 00:01:01,147
On Arc, payout, bounty, and gas are all USDC.

18
00:01:01,974 --> 00:01:02,895
This settlement used

19
00:01:02,915 --> 00:01:07,180
0.00171944 USDC for gas.

20
00:01:07,992 --> 00:01:10,234
Callers still need gas money up front.

21
00:01:12,368 --> 00:01:15,621
The sender, payee, and caller were the same builder-controlled

22
00:01:15,641 --> 00:01:16,157
wallet.

23
00:01:16,983 --> 00:01:18,594
The sender also settled.

24
00:01:19,406 --> 00:01:23,097
This is not a keeper network, a profit guarantee, or evidence

25
00:01:23,117 --> 00:01:24,341
of independent use.

26
00:01:26,468 --> 00:01:29,032
Explore the live app and its public source.

27
00:01:29,859 --> 00:01:32,436
Review the pinned contract and both receipts.

28
00:01:33,248 --> 00:01:35,980
Porter is an early scheduled-payment prototype.
